1271               /  THIS ROUTINE HAS THE RESPONSIBILITY OF PERFORMING PRIMARY PARSING
1272               /OF THE INPUT FILE.  ON A CALL TO SCAN, THE INPUT LINE IS READ UNTIL
1273               /A DELIMITER IS FOUND. ANY IDENTIFIER IS STORED IN ACCUM, ANY NUMBER
1274               /ACCUMULATION IS PERFORMED AND STORED INTO ACCNUM.  IF THE DELIMITER
1275               /IS A SPACE, SCAN WILL SEARCH FOR THE NEXT DELIMITER AFTER THAT,  IF
1276               /NONE, THEN SPACE IS RETURNED AS THE DELIMITER.   ARGUMENT ACCUMULA-
1277               /TION IS GUIDED BY THE CODE CONTAINED IN LOCATION VALID.
